they are considered supremely complete. Malligamadbhaktjanadarshanasparshanarchanam. Service, praise, and chanting of the Lord's virtues. 34). By listening to the stories, faith, meditation, and strength are gained. Sarvalabhopaharanam Dasyenaatmanivedanam. 35. Majjanmakarmakathanam mama parayanumodanam. Gitantandavaditragoshtibhirmadgruhotsavah. 36. Yatra balividhanam cha sarvavarsikaparvasasu. Vedic Tantric initiation, taking the vow of a disciple. 37). The establishment of the Mamachara, the faith itself is the meditation. In the temples of the city, the sacrificial rites are performed. 38. Samarmanopalepabhyam sekamandalavartanaih. Home-based education is great, I am a servant, by my mother. 39. The unjustified pride of arrogance is the unjustified praise of one's own. Even the light of the lamp is not enough for me to see. 40. Whatever is most beloved by all in the world.
I offer myself to you, O infinite one, for the sake of the end. 41. Meaning of the word

